---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Our Purpose — Base Impact" description="Base Impact's mission: technology help — devices, internet, and the skills to use them.">
  <div class="picture-band">
    <img src="/assets/tech-help-digital-skills.jpg" alt="Volunteer helping a neighbor learn digital skills on a laptop" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </div>
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">Our Purpose</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    <p>Base Impact exists to help neighbors get connected and help small local nonprofits keep their technology working.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">What we believe</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Everyone deserves access</strong> — to a working device, internet service, and the skills to use them.</li>
      <li><strong>Small groups matter</strong> — Churches, pantries, and 1–5 person nonprofits are the backbone of community help. They deserve good tech support.</li>
      <li><strong>Local first</strong> — We serve communities because that's where the need is.</li>
      <li><strong>Simple is better</strong> — Our resource directory makes local services easier to find.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Who we serve</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Neighbors who need a working device, internet service, or help using them — especially people navigating housing, jobs, benefits, and health care.</li>
      <li>Small nonprofits, churches, and pantries in Brevard County that serve those neighbors.</li>
      <li>Anyone in the community looking for a simpler, local starting point for help.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">What we do</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li><a href="/technology-access" class="text-accent font-semibold">Technology Access</a> — refurbished devices and help getting connected.</li>
      <li><a href="/programs/digital-skills" class="text-accent font-semibold">Digital Skills &amp; Job Help</a> — patient one-on-one walk-throughs.</li>
      <li><a href="/programs/nonprofit-tech" class="text-accent font-semibold">Tech for Small Nonprofits</a> — free setup, security, and support.</li>
      <li><a href="/directory" class="text-accent font-semibold">Resource Directory</a> — verified local listings, sorted by distance.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Our approach</h2>
    <p>Immediate needs first. Then the skills and tools that keep people housed, employed, and connected. We start with what's urgent and build from there.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
